### ==========================================================================
### Feature 1: Skill-gap suggestions (Ollama llama3.2:3b)
### Input: Student skill assessment scores + Target role requirements
### First call generates via Ollama; identical request returns cached: true
### ==========================================================================

POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/skill-gap
Authorization: Basic student:student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "stu-001",
  "targetRole": "Junior Data Engineer",
  "postingId": "post-42",
  "targetRequirements": ["SQL", "Python", "Apache Spark", "AWS"],
  "currentSkills": [
    { "skill": "Python", "level": 85.0 },
    { "skill": "Data Analysis", "level": 78.0 },
    { "skill": "React", "level": 65.0 },
    { "skill": "Machine Learning", "level": 42.0 },
    { "skill": "AWS Cloud", "level": 35.0 }
  ]
}

### ==========================================================================
### Feature 2: Embedding-based matching (Ollama nomic-embed-text)
### Embeddings compute asynchronously in the background via @Async executor
### ==========================================================================

### 2a. Update Student Profile skills & interests (triggers async embedding)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matching/students/skills
Authorization: Basic student:student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "stu-001",
  "skills": ["Python", "Data Analysis", "SQL", "React"],
  "interests": ["web development", "backend systems"]
}

### 2b. Upsert Job/Internship Posting 1 (triggers async embedding)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matching/postings
Authorization: Basic student:student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postingId": "post-001",
  "title": "Data Analytics Intern",
  "type": "internship",
  "status": "open",
  "skills": ["Python", "Data Analysis", "SQL"],
  "interests": ["healthcare analytics"]
}

### 2c. Upsert Job/Internship Posting 2 (triggers async embedding)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matching/postings
Authorization: Basic student:student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postingId": "post-003",
  "title": "Full Stack Developer Intern",
  "type": "internship",
  "status": "open",
  "skills": ["React", "Node.js", "MongoDB"],
  "interests": ["web development"]
}

### 2d. Compute Match Score (0.6 * cosineSimilarity + 0.4 * keywordOverlap)
### Wait 2-3 seconds after the POSTs so nomic-embed-text finishes in background
GET http://localhost:8080/api/matching?studentId=stu-001
Authorization: Basic student:student

### ==========================================================================
### Feature 3: Resume / Certificate Skill Extraction (Ollama llama3.2:3b)
### Extracts structured skills list + proficiency guess for student confirmation
### ==========================================================================

POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/extract-skills
Authorization: Basic student:student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resumeText": "Experienced Computer Science undergraduate with 2 years of hands-on experience building web applications using React, JavaScript, and Node.js. Proficient in designing RESTful APIs with Spring Boot and MongoDB. Basic familiarity with Docker containerization and AWS EC2 deployments. Strong problem solving and team collaboration skills demonstrated during SIH Hackathons."
}

### ==========================================================================
### Feature 4: AI Portfolio Bio Generation (Ollama llama3.2:3b)
### Generates a professional 3-4 sentence summary/bio for the student portfolio
### ==========================================================================

POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/generate-bio
Authorization: Basic student:student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Aarav Sharma",
  "targetRole": "Full Stack Software Engineer",
  "skills": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "React", "MongoDB", "Docker", "REST APIs"],
  "projects": [
    "Academia-Industry Collaboration Portal (Smart India Hackathon)",
    "Real-time Chat and Notification Engine using WebSockets"
  ],
  "certifications": [
    "AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner",
    "Oracle Certified Associate Java SE"
  ],
  "achievements": [
    "Top 5 finalist at National Level Hackathon 2025",
    "Maintained 8.9 CGPA in Computer Science"
  ]
}
